From: Paul Moore <paul.moore@hp.com>
Subject: [RFC PATCH v1 1/2] lsm: Add hooks to the TUN driver
To: netdev@vger.kernel.org, linux-security-module@vger.kernel.org,
        selinux@tycho.nsa.gov
Date: Tue, 04 Aug 2009 17:21:58 -0400
Message-ID: <20090804212158.10798.34592.stgit@flek.lan>
In-Reply-To: <20090804211304.10798.65601.stgit@flek.lan>
References: <20090804211304.10798.65601.stgit@flek.lan>
